    "body": "local commit 252d533 on issue/34-g76-threading (not pushed yet): the thread kernel carries a `cl::ThreadCycle` record beside its passes (stream `THREAD ... / THREAD END`, cache key `threads`); new undoable document option `PostOptions.threading` (G32 default / G76), and the Fanuc Lathe post writes the two-block G76 from the record when G76 is chosen, refusing by name when the record is missing or out of range. Golden `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/fanuc-lathe/thread_g76.nc`; pinned by `lathe_post_g76` (5 tests) and motion `turning_thread_cycle`. Existing goldens unchanged.\n",
